% expect-output: typecheck
% expect-output: typecheck
% expect-output: typecheck
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: ill-typed known keys. setpagedevice checks the type of the
% entries it recognises: a string for InputAttributes, an integer for
% Duplex, and a real for NumCopies are each a typecheck, while null is
% accepted for ImagingBBox.
% Expect: typecheck three times, then true.
{ << /InputAttributes (tray) >> setpagedevice } stopped pop $error /errorname get =
{ << /Duplex 1 >> setpagedevice } stopped pop $error /errorname get =
{ << /NumCopies 1.5 >> setpagedevice } stopped pop $error /errorname get =
<< /ImagingBBox null >> setpagedevice
currentpagedevice /ImagingBBox get null eq =
